flowchart LR
    accTitle: ImmersionCaption component architecture
    accDescr: AppContainer assembles native presentation, a caption session, domain policies, and replaceable local providers. Current adapters connect to macOS frameworks and local Ollama. Embedded inference and direct model management are planned.

    subgraph App["ImmersionCaption.app · composition root: AppContainer"]
        subgraph Presentation["Presentation · MainActor"]
            Views["SwiftUI views<br/>MainView · MenuBarView<br/>Controls · Settings · History"]
            Overlay["Floating subtitles<br/>SubtitleOverlayController<br/>NSPanel + SubtitleView"]
        end

        Session["CaptionSession · MainActor<br/>Lifecycle · cancellation · timed clauses<br/>Queue · context · in-memory history"]
        Settings["AppSettings<br/>Appearance + backend preferences"]
        Core["CaptionCore · local Foundation package<br/>Caption · TranslationInput · SessionState<br/>SpeechSegment · CaptionLength<br/>TranscriptSegmenter · BoundedQueue<br/>TranslationPrompt · LocalEndpoint"]

        subgraph Providers["Application ports → current infrastructure adapters"]
            Capture["SystemAudioCapturing<br/>↓ CoreAudioTapCapture<br/>System audio only · dedicated queue"]
            Speech["SpeechRecognizing<br/>↓ AppleSpeechRecognizer<br/>On-device Mandarin required"]
            Translation["TranslationEngine<br/>↓ OllamaTranslationEngine<br/>TranslateGemma request / response"]
        end

        subgraph Future["Planned · standalone deployment"]
            Embedded["Embedded inference adapter<br/>Same TranslationEngine interface<br/>App-managed local model files"]
        end
    end

    CoreAudio["Core Audio process taps<br/>System Audio Recording permission"]
    SpeechKit["Speech framework<br/>OS-managed Mandarin model"]
    Defaults[("UserDefaults<br/>Preferences only")]
    Ollama["Ollama + translategemma:4b<br/>Separate local process<br/>127.0.0.1:11434"]

    Views -->|"controls / observes"| Session
    Overlay -->|"observes captions"| Session
    Views -->|"binds preferences"| Settings
    Overlay -->|"observes appearance"| Settings
    Session -->|"business rules / values"| Core
    Session -->|"capture port"| Capture
    Session -->|"speech port"| Speech
    Session -->|"translation port"| Translation
    Translation -->|"prompt / endpoint policy"| Core
    Capture -->|"native API"| CoreAudio
    Speech -->|"on-device API"| SpeechKit
    Translation <-->|"loopback HTTP"| Ollama
    Settings -->|"stores preferences"| Defaults
    Translation -. "replace adapter (planned)" .-> Embedded

